AUDIO: 'Last week, the prime president of Australia that stood up at the United Nations and announced that an agent from OpenAI had broken into the country\'s Medicare database. And when they tried to stop it, it wouldn\'t take no for an answer. But from what I can tell, this is the first time in history where an'

